    "gives": "whole years from from to to: an age on a day. When to ≥ from, the number of anniversaries of from that fall on or before to, where an anniversary on a day the year lacks (29 February in a common year) falls on the last day of that month (28 February). When to < from, minus `years_between(to, from)`: the count goes towards zero, and swapping the arguments changes only the sign. 2000-02-29 → 2001-02-28 is 1; 2000-02-29 → 2004-02-29 is 4; 2023-07-01 → 2024-06-30 is 0; 2024-06-30 → 2023-07-01 is 0 (not −1); 2024-07-01 → 2023-07-01 is −1"
